graph TD

    user[Operator or Driver]
    charger[Physical or Simulated Charger]

    subgraph presentation[Presentation Layer]
        dashboard[Next.js Dashboard Port 9000]
        simulator[Browser Charger Simulator]
    end

    subgraph backend[CSMS Backend]
        csms[Hono and Bun CSMS Port 6773]
        ocpp[OCPP Message Handler]
        sessions[Sessions Billing and Monitoring]
    end

    subgraph services[Supporting Services]
        database[PostgreSQL and Prisma ORM]
        balancer[Go Load Balancer Port 8787]
        redis[Redis Planned]
    end

    user --> dashboard
    dashboard -->|HTTP API| csms
    dashboard -->|Controls| simulator
    simulator -->|OCPP WebSocket| csms
    charger -->|OCPP WebSocket| csms

    csms --> ocpp
    csms --> sessions
    ocpp -->|Store charger events| database
    sessions -->|Store sessions invoices and meter readings| database

    csms -->|POST v1 allocate| balancer
    balancer -->|Power allocation result| csms

    csms -->|Live WebSocket updates| dashboard
    csms -->|Charging profile command| simulator
    csms -.->|Future live state and pub sub| redis
